# classifier/ local secrets/config — never commit real credentials or tokens.
# .env itself is the exception (as of 2026-08-19): it's intentionally
# tracked, but transparently AES-256 encrypted at rest by git-crypt (see
# .gitattributes), so GitHub only ever stores/serves ciphertext. credentials
# and OAuth tokens below stay plaintext-ignored, never committed in any form.
credentials.json
token.json
